#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/transform/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"Derive a warp-specialization schedule with the scheduler named by the ``tl."
"enable_auto_schedule`` pass config (currently ``\"role_based\"``); a no-op "
"when the config is unset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/transform/index.rst:44
msgid ""
"Eligible kernels gain stable ``tl.ws_op_id`` markers and a typed "
"``WSSchedule`` block annotation — the same surface a hand-written schedule "
"uses — which :func:`MaterializeWSSchedule` then lowers. Kernels the "
"scheduler declines are left unchanged."
msgstr ""

