#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/transform/index.rst:65
msgid ""
"This pass runs before LayoutInference and LowerTileOp. It rewrites eligible "
"pipelined tile-op loops into warp-specialized producer and consumer branches "
"with explicit barrier synchronization."
msgstr ""

